        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geometry Shooter PRO takes the exciting foundation of the original Geometry Shooter and cranks it up to the next level! Jump into this hand-drawn arcade game where precision meets action and smart planning. What seems straightforward at first, reveals multiple layers and a variety of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/4795ee325196dcc97e379da19f3bcfff.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire from a moving cannon at expanding geometric shapes like circles, squares, and triangles. Aim to hit as many as you can with a single shot, as a new shape will emerge where the fired bullet lands. Each figure displays a number indicating how many hits it takes to destroy it, so strategize your shots wisely. It's not all about a good aim, but also smart planning and anticipating what's coming next! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/c77eaa7cbaf36f6c8430b345e5ff3869.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the use of cool power-ups you can utilize even more diverse strategies! Collect bombs that crush through your targets, or hit extra life points to keep the fun going. Be careful though - newly formed shapes can effectively block your options, and if a fired bullet goes back behind the line of your cannon, you'll lose one life! Decide whether it's worth risking a tricky shot to collect a helpful power-up before it disappears, or choose a safer option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bdc8a72bbcad74c24e205b56c3ed472e.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Geometry Shooter PRO, you can top your scores in single-player mode, challenge friends head-to-head in versus mode, or collaborate with them in co-op mode! Find a way to surprise and block your opponents or a clever strategy to support your teammates. Shoot a variety of targets together and try to survive as long as you can! All of this presented with attractive graphics and entertaining sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/e9c7afdc065b3c70edf0431538c082c0.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Enjoy easy to understand, yet skill based gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Have fun with other players in versus and co-op modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect useful power-ups to help you in your struggles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Top your scores in the leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Admire hand-drawn graphics and cool sound effects </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geometry Shooter PRO takes the exciting foundation of the original Geometry Shooter and cranks it up to the next level! Jump into this hand-drawn arcade game where precision meets action and smart planning. What seems straightforward at first, reveals multiple layers and a variety of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/4795ee325196dcc97e379da19f3bcfff.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire from a moving cannon at expanding geometric shapes like circles, squares, and triangles. Aim to hit as many as you can with a single shot, as a new shape will emerge where the fired bullet lands. Each figure displays a number indicating how many hits it takes to destroy it, so strategize your shots wisely. It's not all about a good aim, but also smart planning and anticipating what's coming next! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/c77eaa7cbaf36f6c8430b345e5ff3869.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the use of cool power-ups you can utilize even more diverse strategies! Collect bombs that crush through your targets, or hit extra life points to keep the fun going. Be careful though - newly formed shapes can effectively block your options, and if a fired bullet goes back behind the line of your cannon, you'll lose one life! Decide whether it's worth risking a tricky shot to collect a helpful power-up before it disappears, or choose a safer option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bdc8a72bbcad74c24e205b56c3ed472e.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Geometry Shooter PRO, you can top your scores in single-player mode, challenge friends head-to-head in versus mode, or collaborate with them in co-op mode! Find a way to surprise and block your opponents or a clever strategy to support your teammates. Shoot a variety of targets together and try to survive as long as you can! All of this presented with attractive graphics and entertaining sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/e9c7afdc065b3c70edf0431538c082c0.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Enjoy easy to understand, yet skill based gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Have fun with other players in versus and co-op modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect useful power-ups to help you in your struggles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Top your scores in the leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Admire hand-drawn graphics and cool sound effects </p>",
        "short_description": "Blast through shapes and numbers in this addictive hand-drawn arcade shooter! Geometry Shooter PRO offers singleplayer, multiplayer versus and co-op modes, as well as powerful bonus balls for even more chaotic fun. Be precise, count fast, and shoot your geometric targets! Ready to top your score?",
